@baseUrl = http://localhost:5128

### 1. Get weather forecast for Tokyo (Cache MISS -> generates and caches)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/weatherforecast/Tokyo
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get weather forecast for Tokyo again (Cache HIT -> returns from cache)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/weatherforecast/Tokyo
Accept: application/json

### 3. Manually set custom forecast for Hanoi
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/weatherforecast/Hanoi
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "temperatureC": 32,
  "summary": "Sunny and humid",
  "ttlSeconds": 300
}

### 4. Get all cached items with prefix 'weather:'
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/weatherforecast/prefix/weather:
Accept: application/json

### 5. Evict Tokyo from cache
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/weatherforecast/Tokyo

### 6. Get Tokyo again (Cache MISS -> generates new forecast)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/weatherforecast/Tokyo
Accept: application/json
